name: Safe inventory members survive unavailable paths, with honest partial receipts and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_partial.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 30 context:build indexed 3 files | complete-baseline
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_partial.py @TMP_TARGET @ART capture
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_partial.py @TMP_TARGET @ART redirect
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 30 context:build partial inventory | partial-context
expect: component/source.rs
submit: run pack:suggest-shards {}
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 30 PARTIAL inventory | partial-scope-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_partial.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Recorded warning | partial-receipt
expect: Outcome · partial
ask: Does the partial result lead with the actual unavailable path, retain its safe source member and keep scope acceptance separate?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: partial-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: partial-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: partial-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: partial-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: partial-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-paged-40x12
ask: Is the limitation readable across terminal sizes, with useful paging and no complete-coverage claim?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Recorded warning | restarted-receipt
expect: Outcome · partial
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inventory_partial.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the same partial evidence and prior receipts without repeating work or spending?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
